OL,3,GNEWSAWidow waits five years for trial
OL,4,Aof husband's carer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe widow of a man who was allegedly
OL,7,Fmistreated by his carer will have
OL,8,Fwaited more than five years for the
OL,9,Fcase to reach court.
OL,11,FFormer fish and chip shop owner John
OL,12,FDutton suffered a severe stroke in 2017
OL,13,Fthat left him in a wheelchair, unable
OL,14,Fto speak and needing 24-hour care.
OL,16,FBefore he died in 2022, concerns were
OL,17,Fraised over the way he was being
OL,18,Ftreated, and his carer, Jasbir Kau, 44,
OL,19,Fwas later arrested and charged with
OL,20,Fthree counts of ill treatment or
OL,21,Fneglect by a care worker.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
