OL,3,GNEWSAWidow waits five years for trial
OL,4,Aof husband's carer
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn's wife Christine, 80, from
OL,7,FHuddersfield, says that after multiple
OL,8,Fcourt dates were cancelled and pushed
OL,9,Fback, she has now been given a fixed
OL,10,Fdate of August 2027, but that the
OL,11,Fprocess has left the family
OL,12,F"exhausted".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
